// ============================================================
// SPECIALTIES (subclasses): features, spells, proficiencies,
// number changes and counters. Keys match the names in SUBCLASSES.
//   features: [level, name, text, tag]  (same tags as CLASS_FEATURES)
//   spells:   { classLevel: [spell ids] } with spellMode:
//             'prepared' always prepared, 'known' always known (neither counts),
//             'expanded' only added to the list you can pick from
//   cantrips: free cantrips; list: another class's list you can pick from
//   options:  a second choice (terrain, totem, ancestry) shown next to the specialty
//   res:      [level, id, name, max, reset, pool]; max is a number, 'pb',
//             an ability ('wis', 'cha', 'int' = modifier, min 1) or a function
// ============================================================
